Package: mitranet-config-engine
Version: 1.0.2-1~deb13u1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MitraNet Core Team <support@mitranet.id>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), python3-jsonschema | python3
Description: MitraNet Configuration, Validation & Transaction Engine
 MitraNet Rinjani 1.0.2 native configuration engine.
 Implements JSON Schema validation, candidate/running configuration
 decoupling, atomic transactions, dry-run evaluation, pre-apply
 snapshots, automated recovery, and state persistence.
